  lines:
  - speakerNameKey: "B\xE1c Otis"
    textKey: "Hai D\u01B0 \xC2m \u0111\xE3 tr\u1EA3 l\u1EA1i s\u1EF1 th\u1EADt tr\u1ECDn v\u1EB9n cho c\u1EA3 Kael l\u1EABn Mara r\u1ED3i."
